+// This file tests the VNNI (Vector Neural Network Instructions) K storage layout
+// (Note [K VNNI storage] in kv_cache.hpp) through its typed owner and views
+// (h/tron/tensor/k_vnni.hpp) and its AVX-512 (the 512-bit Advanced Vector
+// Extensions) score reader. No AMX (Advanced Matrix Extensions, the tile
+// instruction set) instruction runs here. So every case runs on every host.
